ns and moves they will abuse. Still fun tho. 8/10", "timestamp_created": 1674483173, "timestamp_updated": 1674483173, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "131381895", "author": {"steamid": "76561198013035947", "personaname": "WreckWren", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/wreckwren/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 416, "playtime_forever": 1274, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1273, "last_played": 1744803016, "avatar": "c1e74e74842c70b397ddea91e82a46916f4555ff"}, "language": "english", "review": "The pricing for this game is hilarious, do not pay full price for this.\nThat said, lots of fun if you like Gears of War - just a little janky and low-rent in comparison (enemies and movement feel very stiff, textures are crap, very little ground clutter).\nIf you stick with it past the boring intro sequence there is some very cool stuff to see and do.\n\nFor example, you can mash B, and you can move forward!", "timestamp_created": 1674445784, "timestamp_updated": 1733911895, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.393574267625808716", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}]}